From: Yunkai Zhang <yunkai.me@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 20:40:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(qqbot): prevent Resume death-loop and zombie state

Combines PR #17990 (window tracking + quick disconnect + backoff cap)
and PR #19414 (zombie state notification + reconnect hardening).

Changes:
1. _exc_disconnect_count window tracking (5/300s -> force Identify)
2. Quick disconnect detection in Exception branch
3. _set_fatal_error() on ALL 3 exit paths (4008, QQCloseError, Exception)
   -> prevents zombie state where process lives but doesn't respond
4. CLOSED/ERROR -> QQCloseError (preserve close codes)
5. 15s cooldown on reconnect failure
6. Heartbeat interval only reset after successful connection

gateway/platforms/qqbot/adapter.py | 75 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

